        "original_id": "1b3d1356-728a-51a6-b8ec-71f82d344471",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Pigman's Bar-B-Que\n- Places: Outer Banks, North Carolina\n- Products: Southern Living\n- People: Hugh Howard\n- Works: Houses of Civil War America\n- Topics: Southern culture, travel\n\nFacts:\n- Pigman's Bar-B-Que is an Outer Banks landmark and a premiere barbecue restaurant on the Outer Banks of North Carolina.\n- Pigman's Bar-B-Que has been featured in Southern Living magazine and The Coast.\n- Southern Living is a widely read lifestyle magazine for readers in the Southern United States that features recipes, house plans, garden plans, and information about Southern culture and travel.\n- In Fall 2014, Southern Living listed Hugh Howard's book Houses of Civil War America as one of its best illustrated books.",
